        "original_id": "8a7fdef1-d3fd-52c2-8c8a-b37486c2e95a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jon Heder, Jaclyn Hales, Rob Schneider, David Spade, Patrick Stewart, James Roday, Julianna Guill, Cheryl Hines, Gary Cole, Roy Disney\n- Films and Series: Napoleon Dynamite, The Benchwarmers, School for Scoundrels, Blades of Glory, Mama's Boy, When in Rome, Walt Before Mickey, Monster House, Surf's Up, Christmas Eve, Scents and Sensibility, Unicorn City, Alienate\n- Companies: Revolution Studios, Happy Madison Productions, Columbia Pictures\n- Roles and Topics: American actor, producer, actress, voice acting, ensemble cast\n\nFacts:\n- Jon Heder was born on October 26, 1977, and he is an American actor and producer.\n- Jon Heder made his feature film debut in 2004 as the title character in the comedy film \"Napoleon Dynamite.\"\n- Jon Heder starred in \"The Benchwarmers\" with Rob Schneider and David Spade.\n- \"The Benchwarmers\" was produced by Revolution Studios and Happy Madison Productions and distributed by Columbia Pictures.\n- Jon Heder also acted in \"School for Scoundrels,\" \"Blades of Glory,\" \"Mama's Boy,\" \"When in Rome,\" and \"Walt Before Mickey,\" in which he played Roy Disney.\n- Jon Heder provided voice acting for the animated films \"Monster House\" and \"Surf's Up,\" and for the \"Napoleon Dynamite\" animated series.\n- Jaclyn Hales was born on September 4, 1986, and she is an American actress.\n- Jaclyn Hales is known for acting in \"Scents and Sensibility\" (2011), \"Unicorn City\" (2012), \"Christmas Eve\" (2015), and \"Alienate\" (2016).\n- The 2015 film \"Christmas Eve\" features an ensemble cast led by Patrick Stewart, James Roday, Julianna Guill, Jon Heder, Cheryl Hines, and Gary Cole.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
